      <p class="muted small">4 pages · PDF · The French version is the official version of the agreement.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contract-section">
      <h2>Clear guide: insurance &amp; &ldquo;who pays what&rdquo;</h2>
      <p>A simple, complete summary of the insurance coverage and your responsibilities, so there are no surprises.</p>
      <div class="doc-grid">
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Insurance-Guide-YBMTL-EN.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇬🇧</span>
