          <span class="doc-dl">Download&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Guide-Assurances-YBMTL-FR.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇫🇷</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Français</strong><small>Guide du locataire · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Télécharger&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conditions-summary">
      <h2>Summary of the main terms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Booking:</strong> Bookings are made by online request. We confirm by phone or email.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment:</strong> No online payment. Payment is made directly to Location YBMTL at the time of the rental (cheque, bank transfer, cash, debit or credit card).</li>
        <li><strong>Taxes:</strong> Starting October 1, 2026, GST (5%) and QST (9.975%) are added to the rental price, excluding the security deposit. The prices shown are before taxes.</li>
        <li><strong>Insurance:</strong> Car insurance is mandatory. We accept your personal insurance, or you can take out our rental insurance.</li>
        <li><strong>Security deposit:</strong> A security deposit may be requested, depending on the length of the rental and the options chosen.</li>
        <li><strong>Mileage:</strong> The mileage terms (limited or unlimited) are specific to each vehicle and confirmed when we confirm your booking.</li>
        <li><strong>Vehicle condition:</strong> A condition report is completed before and after the rental to protect everyone.</li>
        <li><strong>Minimum age:</strong> The main driver must be at least 25 years old and hold a driver's licence that has been valid for at least 3 years.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="conditions-contact">
      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>For any question about our terms or our agreement, feel free to contact us:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:<%= company.phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g,'') %>"><%= company.phone %></a><br>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:<%= company.email %>"><%= company.email %></a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
